<%!-- Hero Section --%>
<section class="py-16 px-6 lg:px-10">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl md:max-w-3xl lg:max-w-4xl text-center">
    <h1 class="font-display text-5xl/12 tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-6xl text-olive-950 dark:text-white">
      What We Believe
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg/7 text-olive-600 dark:text-olive-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-balance">
      When institutions fail to hold the powerful accountable, communities must rise together.
      Apology.io gives collective voice to those who demand better.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<%!-- Values Section --%>
<section class="py-16 px-6 lg:px-10">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl md:max-w-3xl lg:max-w-4xl">
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight text-olive-950 dark:text-white mb-12 text-center">
      Our Core Values
    </h2>

    <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
      <%!-- Accountability --%>
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-olive-900 p-8 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-olive-950/5 dark:ring-white/10">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-olive-100 dark:bg-olive-800 mb-6">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-olive-600 dark:text-olive-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 0 1 3.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 0 0 3 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285Z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl tracking-tight text-olive-950 dark:text-white mb-3">
          Accountability
        </h3>
        <p class="text-olive-600 dark:text-olive-300">
          Power must answer to the people. We believe that those in positions of authority have
          a responsibility to address legitimate grievances openly and honestly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <%!-- Transparency --%>
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-olive-900 p-8 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-olive-950/5 dark:ring-white/10">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-olive-100 dark:bg-olive-800 mb-6">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-olive-600 dark:text-olive-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.036 12.322a1.012 1.012 0 0 1 0-.639C3.423 7.51 7.36 4.5 12 4.5c4.638 0 8.573 3.007 9.963 7.178.07.207.07.431 0 .639C20.577 16.49 16.64 19.5 12 19.5c-4.638 0-8.573-3.007-9.963-7.178Z" />
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 12a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl tracking-tight text-olive-950 dark:text-white mb-3">
          Transparency
        </h3>
        <p class="text-olive-600 dark:text-olive-300">
          Public grievances deserve a public record. We create an open, documented space
          where concerns are visible and cannot be ignored or swept away.
        </p>
      </div>

      <%!-- Collective Action --%>
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-olive-900 p-8 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-olive-950/5 dark:ring-white/10">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-olive-100 dark:bg-olive-800 mb-6">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-olive-600 dark:text-olive-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M18 18.72a9.094 9.094 0 0 0 3.741-.479 3 3 0 0 0-4.682-2.72m.94 3.198.001.031c0 .225-.012.447-.037.666A11.944 11.944 0 0 1 12 21c-2.17 0-4.207-.576-5.963-1.584A6.062 6.062 0 0 1 6 18.719m12 0a5.971 5.971 0 0 0-.941-3.197m0 0A5.995 5.995 0 0 0 12 12.75a5.995 5.995 0 0 0-5.058 2.772m0 0a3 3 0 0 0-4.681 2.72 8.986 8.986 0 0 0 3.74.477m.94-3.197a5.971 5.971 0 0 0-.94 3.197M15 6.75a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Zm6 3a2.25 2.25 0 1 1-4.5 0 2.25 2.25 0 0 1 4.5 0Zm-13.5 0a2.25 2.25 0 1 1-4.5 0 2.25 2.25 0 0 1 4.5 0Z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl tracking-tight text-olive-950 dark:text-white mb-3">
          Collective Action
        </h3>
        <p class="text-olive-600 dark:text-olive-300">
          Many voices, one demand. Individual complaints can be dismissed, but when a
          community speaks together, silence becomes impossible.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%!-- How It Works Section --%>
<section class="py-16 px-6 lg:px-10">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl md:max-w-3xl lg:max-w-4xl">
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight text-olive-950 dark:text-white mb-8 text-center">
      How It Works
    </h2>

    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-olive-900 p-8 md:p-12 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-olive-950/5 dark:ring-white/10">
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-olive-950 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-olive-950 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-semibold">
            1
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-olive-950 dark:text-white mb-1">Identify a Grievance</h3>
            <p class="text-olive-600 dark:text-olive-300">
              Someone identifies an issue where accountability is needed - corporate malfeasance,
              institutional failures, or broken promises by those in power.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-olive-950 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-olive-950 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-semibold">
            2
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-olive-950 dark:text-white mb-1">Create an Initiative</h3>
            <p class="text-olive-600 dark:text-olive-300">
              An initiative is created that documents the grievances, identifies the responsible
              parties, and articulates the demand for accountability.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-olive-950 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-olive-950 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-semibold">
            3
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-olive-950 dark:text-white mb-1">Gather Signatures</h3>
            <p class="text-olive-600 dark:text-olive-300">
              Community members add their voices by signing the initiative, building momentum
              and demonstrating the breadth of concern.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-olive-950 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-olive-950 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-semibold">
            4
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-olive-950 dark:text-white mb-1">Demand Accountability</h3>
            <p class="text-olive-600 dark:text-olive-300">
              With documented grievances and collective support, the initiative becomes a
              powerful tool for demanding meaningful response and change.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%!-- CTA Section --%>
<section class="py-16 px-6 lg:px-10">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl md:max-w-3xl lg:max-w-4xl text-center">
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight text-olive-950 dark:text-white mb-4">
      Ready to Make Your Voice Heard?
    </h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-olive-600 dark:text-olive-300 mb-8">
      Browse active initiatives and add your signature to the causes that matter to you.
    </p>
    <.link
      navigate={~p"/"}
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-olive-950 dark:bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white dark:text-olive-950 hover:bg-olive-800 dark:hover:bg-olive-100 transition"
    >
      View Active Initiatives
      <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
      </svg>
    </.link>
  </div>
</section>
